blocks.mermaid:
flowchart TD
    A["Visual field loss"] --> B{"One eye only?"}
    B -->|Yes| C["Eye or OPTIC NERVE<br/>on that side"]
    B -->|"No - both eyes"| D{"Which halves?"}
    D -->|"Both outer (temporal) halves"| E["OPTIC CHIASM<br/>bitemporal hemianopia"]
    D -->|"Same side in both eyes"| F["Behind the chiasm, OPPOSITE side<br/>optic tract, radiations or V1<br/>homonymous hemianopia"]

flowchart TD
    A["Movement disorder, power normal"] --> B{"When is the tremor worst?"}
    B -->|"At rest, eases with movement"| C["BASAL GANGLIA - Parkinson disease<br/>rigidity, slow to start, progressive"]
    B -->|"At the end of a movement"| D["CEREBELLUM<br/>dysmetria, low tone, same-side signs"]
    A --> E{"Extra movements instead?"}
    E -->|"Dance-like, unwanted"| F["BASAL GANGLIA - chorea<br/>Huntington disease or too much levodopa"]

flowchart TD
    A["Weak muscles"] --> B{"Wasting, fasciculations,<br/>reduced reflexes, low tone?"}
    B -->|Yes| C["LOWER MOTOR NEURON<br/>ventral horn, root, nerve"]
    B -->|No| D{"Brisk reflexes, clonus,<br/>raised tone, Babinski up?"}
    D -->|Yes| E["UPPER MOTOR NEURON<br/>cortex or corticospinal tract"]
    D -->|"No - flaccid, within days of onset"| F["Early UPPER MOTOR NEURON lesion<br/>spasticity follows in about a week"]

flowchart TD
    A["Patient with reduced responsiveness"] --> B{"Awake and aware,<br/>but unable to move or answer?"}
    B -->|Yes| C["COMA MIMIC<br/>locked-in syndrome · Guillain-Barré · myasthenia gravis<br/>neuromuscular blockade · akinetic mutism · psychogenic"]
    B -->|No| D["Look for the TREATABLE causes first<br/>shock or low blood pressure · low blood sugar · diabetic ketoacidosis<br/>hypertensive encephalopathy · drugs · encephalitis · abscess<br/>epidural or subdural hematoma"]
    D --> E["Examine: observation · brainstem reflexes · motor responses<br/>score with the Glasgow Coma Scale or the FOUR score"]
    E --> F{"Any brainstem reflex, breathing effort<br/>or motor response?"}
    F -->|"None, apnea test positive,<br/>no confounders"| G["BRAIN DEATH"]
    F -->|Yes| H{"Eyes open, sleep-wake cycles?"}
    H -->|No| I["COMA<br/>no eye opening · reflexes only"]
    H -->|Yes| J{"Any sign of awareness?"}
    J -->|No| K["VEGETATIVE STATE<br/>(unresponsive wakefulness)"]
    J -->|Yes| L{"Follows commands?"}
    L -->|No| M["MINIMALLY CONSCIOUS MINUS<br/>visual pursuit · localizes pain"]
    L -->|Yes| N["MINIMALLY CONSCIOUS PLUS"]

flowchart TD
    A["Possible first seizure"] --> B{"Was it a seizure?<br/>first-hand account: witnesses, ambulance records<br/>onset · the event · the aftermath"}
    B -->|No| C["NON-EPILEPTIC EVENT<br/>look for another cause"]
    B -->|Yes| D{"Needs urgent evaluation?<br/>fever · trauma · ongoing confusion or low consciousness<br/>persistent focal deficit"}
    D -->|Yes| E["URGENT workup"]
    D -->|No| F{"Provoked?<br/>trauma · fever · glucose or sodium · alcohol"}
    E --> F
    F -->|Yes| G["PROVOKED SEIZURE<br/>correct the cause · recurrence low<br/>NO antiseizure drug"]
    F -->|No| H["UNPROVOKED SEIZURE<br/>electrolytes · CT in the emergency department<br/>MRI · EEG"]
    H --> I{"Lesion on MRI or epileptiform discharges on EEG?<br/>or a 2nd unprovoked seizure over 24 h apart?"}
    I -->|Yes| J["EPILEPSY: recurrence 60% or more<br/>RECOMMEND an antiseizure drug"]
    I -->|No| K["SINGLE UNPROVOKED SEIZURE<br/>recurrence under 60%: usually no drug<br/>discuss the options with the patient"]

flowchart TD
    A["Progressive headache, focal deficit,<br/>mental change or focal seizure"] --> B["Contrast-enhanced MRI (gadolinium)<br/>or contrast CT if MRI unavailable"]
    B --> C{"Multiple lesions · ring enhancement<br/>· surrounding edema?"}
    C -->|Yes| D["METASTASIS likely<br/>look for the primary · biopsy if needed"]
    C -->|No| E{"Deep, periventricular,<br/>evenly enhancing?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["Think central nervous system (CNS) LYMPHOMA<br/>avoid steroids before biopsy<br/>eye exam · lumbar puncture · HIV test"]
    E -->|No| G{"Does it enhance?"}
    G -->|"No"| H["LOW-GRADE GLIOMA likely<br/>observe with serial MRI if no symptoms"]
    G -->|"Yes"| I["HIGH-GRADE GLIOMA (grade 3-4)<br/>treat immediately"]

flowchart TD
    A["Tremor or slowness"] --> B{"When is the tremor worst?"}
    B -->|"Holding a posture or moving<br/>symmetric · head and voice<br/>better with alcohol"| C["ESSENTIAL TREMOR"]
    B -->|"At rest · one side first<br/>with slowness and rigidity"| D["PARKINSONISM"]
    D --> E{"Dopamine-blocking drug, stroke,<br/>head injury or toxin?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["SECONDARY PARKINSONISM<br/>remove or treat the cause"]
    E -->|No| G{"Red flags?"}
    G -->|"Vertical gaze palsy · early falls<br/>symmetric · no tremor"| H["PROGRESSIVE SUPRANUCLEAR PALSY"]
    G -->|"Autonomic failure<br/>± cerebellar ataxia"| I["MULTIPLE SYSTEM ATROPHY"]
    G -->|None| J["PARKINSON'S DISEASE"]

flowchart TD
    A["A patient has died"] --> B{"Coroner's case?<br/>sudden and unexpected · unnatural (accident, suicide, homicide)<br/>family concerned about care · death on a psychiatry ward<br/>maternal death · seizure disorder<br/>child death with Children's Aid involvement"}
    B -->|"Yes"| C["Call the coroner<br/>Coroner or medical examiner signs the death certificate<br/>Medicolegal autopsy: family does NOT authorize"]
    B -->|"No: expected natural death"| D["Doctor (or certain nurses) signs the death certificate"]
    D --> E{"Is a hospital autopsy wanted?"}
    E -->|"Yes"| F["Informed authorization from next of kin or estate trustee<br/>they may restrict it: limited internal exam, no organ retention"]

flowchart TD
    A["Patient says they are dizzy"] --> B{"Spinning: true vertigo?"}
    B -->|"No"| C["Dizziness: presyncope, arrhythmia,<br/>orthostatic hypotension, anemia, drugs,<br/>anxiety or panic"]
    B -->|"Yes"| D{"Another brainstem sign?<br/>double vision · crossed sensory loss · ataxic weakness"}
    D -->|"Yes"| E["CENTRAL: treat as a brainstem stroke"]
    D -->|"No"| F{"How long does each attack last?"}
    F -->|"Seconds, on moving the head"| G["BPPV<br/>Dix-Hallpike to diagnose · Epley to treat"]
    F -->|"Seconds, with loud sound or pressure"| H["Superior canal dehiscence<br/>CT of the temporal bone"]
    F -->|"Minutes to hours, recurrent"| I{"Hearing loss, tinnitus, fullness?"}
    I -->|"Yes"| J["Ménière's disease"]
    I -->|"No"| K["Migraine-associated vertigo"]
    F -->|"Hours to days, often after a cold"| L{"Hearing loss?"}
    L -->|"Yes"| M["Labyrinthitis"]
    L -->|"No"| N["Vestibular neuritis"]
